{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/617e2e10cbfeac0f5cd07ca333a007da.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/617e2e10cbfeac0f5cd07ca333a007da.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Fate\u2019s End</strong> is an action-adventure game where you fight the ones you love. Wield the legendary God Sword Aesus as Shan, the deft young heiress of the Hemlock clan. Explore a lush, hand-crafted fantasy world. Defeat the foul creatures of the realm in combat. Solve intricate narrative puzzles, uncover painful truths, and hone both your blade skills and knowledge to face your estranged siblings in intense, emotional duels - and ultimately decide your family\u2019s fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/e6c52bd1802ac37aa009178bab6b2fd1.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/e6c52bd1802ac37aa009178bab6b2fd1.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your blade may cut deep, but your journey will demand more than combat prowess. Shape confrontations through tactical dialogue and psychological insight, using your deep knowledge of your family\u2019s secrets to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/2519ea40f8a4cd24da6d684ef709d0f2.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/2519ea40f8a4cd24da6d684ef709d0f2.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sibling you defeat \u2014 or reconcile with \u2014 shapes your destiny. Collect seven swords of power to expand your arsenal of abilities and ultimately shape your family\u2019s legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/c456b3244ad9b15c0458beaaf01d7fe5.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/c456b3244ad9b15c0458beaaf01d7fe5.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the acclaimed team behind <strong>Spiritfarer</strong>, At Fate\u2019s End weaves tight, visceral action with rich narrative depth, exploring the complicated bonds between brothers and sisters in a world where swords clash and family wounds run deep. Fight with your sword. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/5fa761f0cb48012a9e1cd6be1ad85b86.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/5fa761f0cb48012a9e1cd6be1ad85b86.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2210150?t=1771259330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/c7f0af5192138ba12cfce25cc1470e6f923aa9e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771259330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/29d0d07665ac1c068e253cc9eafb028660af2e36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771259330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/29d0d07665ac1c068e253cc9eafb028660af2e36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771259330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The Narrative of AT FATE'S END can explore mature topics and themes in telling the complex stories and familial relationships between the characters. Characters sometimes use strong or mature language. Rare scenes will feature characters drinking."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/617e2e10cbfeac0f5cd07ca333a007da.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/617e2e10cbfeac0f5cd07ca333a007da.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At Fate\u2019s End</strong> is an action-adventure game where you fight the ones you love. Wield the legendary God Sword Aesus as Shan, the deft young heiress of the Hemlock clan. Explore a lush, hand-crafted fantasy world. Defeat the foul creatures of the realm in combat. Solve intricate narrative puzzles, uncover painful truths, and hone both your blade skills and knowledge to face your estranged siblings in intense, emotional duels - and ultimately decide your family\u2019s fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/e6c52bd1802ac37aa009178bab6b2fd1.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/e6c52bd1802ac37aa009178bab6b2fd1.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your blade may cut deep, but your journey will demand more than combat prowess. Shape confrontations through tactical dialogue and psychological insight, using your deep knowledge of your family\u2019s secrets to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/2519ea40f8a4cd24da6d684ef709d0f2.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/2519ea40f8a4cd24da6d684ef709d0f2.webm?t=1771259330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sibling you defeat \u2014 or reconcile with \u2014 shapes your destiny. Collect seven swords of power to expand your arsenal of abilities and ultimately shape your family\u2019s legacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2210150/extras/c456b3244ad9b15c0458beaaf01d7fe5.poster.avif?t=1771259330\" width=1270 height=694 ><source sr